DESCRIPTION:FAMBULA - BALI....is back once again! THE FAT 'N" FUNKY HOUSE P
 OOL PARTY at Utopia Cave Club! This is the Bali you came for and you just 
 found the guest list so don't pay 250k on the door One day\, one night\, o
 ne feeling\, one family\, in the ultimate venue. Get ready\, Bali! FAMBULA
  — the legendary party sensation that has electrified Nairobi in Kenya\,
  stormed through London’s biggest clubs\, and set the European festival 
 circuit ablaze — lands exclusively at Luna Beach Club's\, UTOPIA on Sund
 ay 22nd November 2026! A Cliff-Top Cave Club with ocean views\, the finest
  food\, perfect cocktails\, quality music. Leave the noise of town...You f
 ound your oasis in Bali UTOPIA at Luna Beach Club is... - An infinity pool
  perched over the breathtaking Nyani beach cliffs - Pumping sound system i
 n the cave - The best sunset spot in Bali — lose yourself in the golden 
