 le - Venuto - Tina T - Seany Rossi From sun-drenched afternoons to starlit
  nights\, move to the funky vocal house rhythms and classic anthems you lo
 ve — all with that very special Fambula flavor. Classy Vibes\, Up-for-It
  Crowd Fambula is made for party people who love to dress up or rock your 
 bikini\, dance hard\, and celebrate life. It’s the place for thrill-seek
 ers\, trendsetters\, and lovers of electrifying house music. With pro ligh
