SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:RITUAL "The Sunset Mansion" ft. Michael Mayer - VILLA PARTY
LOCATION:SUNSET BEACH BALI | Seminyak Beach\, Jl. Sarinande No.25\, Seminya
 k
DESCRIPTION:Dear Earthlings\, Rituals matter. They set the tone\, stir the 
 mood\, and give us a very good excuse to get together. And for our next on
 e\, we’re taking things a little further… On Saturday\, 28th November 
 alongside KAIS EYE MEDIA\, RITUAL starts on the beach before moving into T
 he Sunset Mansion\, an ocean-facing villa\, somewhere between a sunset gat
 hering\, a house party and the kind of night that accidentally turns into 
 breakfast. And this time\, we’re bringing a very special guest. MICHAEL 
 MAYER (Kompakt) / DE Co-founder of the legendary German label Kompakt\, Mi
 chael Mayer has spent more than three decades shaping the more curious\, e
 motional and wonderfully unpredictable corners of electronic music. Produc
 er\, selector\, label boss\, obsessive music digger and\, above all\, a tr
 uly exceptional DJ. From his iconic Immer mixes to Fabric\, DJ-Kicks and c
 ountless dancefloors around the world\, Michael has built a career around 
 one simple idea we happen to agree with: Great music. Great people. The re
 st usually takes care of itself. And he won’t be alone… ANSTASCIA Form
 erly one half of BLOND:ISH and a serious force behind the decks. LUNAR DIS
 CO Our French-Australian troublemakers\, with releases on Crosstown Rebels
 \, Defected and beyond. GADO GADO The minds behind La Piscine Électroniqu
 e and plenty of other questionable good ideas. ANDY CHUNES PNNY crew repre
 sentative and certified record selector. JULIA TIPSY Grooves\, grooves and
  probably a few more grooves. SoFi Flying the Swiss flag and bringing a li
 ttle Alpine mischief to the tropics. And perhaps a few surprises along the
  way… We start early. We finish late. Possibly very early and for breakf
 ast. Sunset. DJs. Food. Drinks. Ocean. Bare feet strongly encouraged. Good
  behaviour entirely optional. TICKETS 100 FREE GUESTLISTS will be released
  through our WhatsApp group. First come\, first served — earthlings move
  fast. Early Release: IDR 100K Second Release: IDR 200K Final Release: IDR
  300K Door: subject to capacity Guestlist\, tickets & updates: https://cha
 t.whatsapp.com/De8S9x6ZHsy0fNNzPGgpbg?mode=gi_t VIP ROOMS Because apparent
 ly having a table wasn’t enough. Get your own room inside the villa — 
 private space\, private bathroom and your little headquarters for the nigh
 t. IDR 10M minimum bar spend Includes 10 tickets. (Additional guests at th
 e regular ticket price) Come early for the sunset. Stay for Michael Mayer.
  Leave whenever your body tells you the ritual is complete. RITUAL MATTERS
 . JOIN THE TRIBE. The Team\, Sunset Beach\, Seminyak. Tickets: https://meg
 atix.co.id/events/ritual-the-sunset-mansion?utm_source=baligasm\n\nMore in
 fo: https://baligasm.com/event/sunset-beach-bali-ritual-sunset-mansion-mic
 hael-mayer-nov-2026\n\nPlease verify with the organizer before attending.
URL:https://baligasm.com/event/sunset-beach-bali-ritual-sunset-mansion-mich
 ael-mayer-nov-2026
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTART:20261128T080000Z
DTEND:20261128T090000Z
END:VEVENT
