SUMMARY:An Evening of Purpose & Possibility
LOCATION:Sofitel Bali Nusa Dua Beach Resort
DESCRIPTION:A year after its inaugural charity gala helped fund a new schoo
 l in Southwest Sumba\, Sofitel Bali Nusa Dua Beach Resort is once again tu
 rning an evening of dining and celebration into an opportunity to give bac
 k. The resort will host its 2 nd Annual Charity Gala Dinner\, An Evening o
 f Purpose & Possibility\, on 11 December 2026. Held from 6pm to 10pm at th
 e Kecak Ballroom \, the evening will bring together Bali’s hospitality a
 nd business communities\, philanthropists\, government representatives\, m
 edia and influencers for a night of food\, entertainment and purposeful gi
 ving. Last year’s gala\, An Evening of Elegance & Empathy\, raised IDR 5
 00 million for Bali Life Foundation . The contribution helped fund a new s
 chool in Southwest Sumba\, which was officially inaugurated in July 2026. 
 Today\, that school stands as a lasting reminder of what collective genero
 sity can achieve.\n\nMore info: https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/
 an-evening-of-purpose-possibility/\n\nPlease verify with the organizer bef
 ore attending.
