SUMMARY:FIRESIDE FEAST: CHRISTMAS AT EMBERS UBUD
LOCATION:Embers Restaurant\, Jl. Bisma No. 97\, Ubud
DESCRIPTION:FIRESIDE FEAST: CHRISTMAS AT EMBERS UBUD A Five-Course Mediterr
 anean-Inspired Christmas Dinner & Celebration Celebrate Christmas in the h
 eart of Ubud with Fireside Feast: Christmas at Embers Ubud\, a five-course
  Mediterranean-inspired Christmas dinner designed for sharing\, savoring\,
  and celebrating together. From 24–26 December 2026\, Embers brings its 
 signature warmth and fire-led cooking to the festive season\, pairing Medi
 terranean-inspired flavors with a relaxed Ubud atmosphere. Gather around t
 he table for an indulgent five-course feast featuring Land & Sea selection
 s or a thoughtfully crafted Vegetarian menu\, with optional wine pairings 
 to complement the evening. As the night unfolds\, settle into the warmth o
 f Embers with live music from 7:30 PM to 9:30 PM. On Christmas Eve\, enjoy
  the intimate sounds of a solo violin\, followed by a solo saxophone perfo
 rmance on Christmas Day. Whether you’re celebrating Christmas with famil
 y\, gathering with friends\, or looking for a memorable festive dinner in 
 Ubud\, Fireside Feast offers an evening filled with generous flavors\, han
 dcrafted drinks\, live music\, and the unmistakable glow of Embers. CHRIST
 MAS DINNER IN UBUD\, SERVED BY THE FIRE Christmas at Embers is about more 
 than a festive meal. It is about slowing down\, gathering around the table
 \, and enjoying the season through food\, music\, and good company. Our fi
 ve-course Mediterranean-inspired Christmas dinner brings together the rich
 ness of land and sea with vibrant seasonal flavors\, while the vegetarian 
 menu offers a beautifully considered alternative for plant-forward diners.
  Pair your feast with selected wines for an elevated festive experience\, 
 or begin the evening with one of our Festive Cocktails\, available from 5:
 00 PM to 7:00 PM. EVENT DETAILS Dates: Thursday–Saturday\, 24–26 Decem
 ber 2026 Dinner: 6:00 PM–11:00 PM Live Music: 7:30 PM–9:30 PM 24 Decem
 ber: Solo Violin 25 December: Solo Saxophone DINNER & WINE PAIRING Land & 
 Sea IDR 1\,550\,000++ per person IDR 2\,000\,000++ per person with wine pa
 iring Vegetarian IDR 950.000++ per person IDR 1.400.000++ per person with 
 wine pairing Festive Cocktails IDR 150.000++ per cocktail Available from 5
 :00 PM–7:00 PM only CELEBRATE CHRISTMAS AT EMBERS Make this Christmas on
 e to remember with a festive dinner in Ubud where Mediterranean-inspired f
 lavors meet the warmth of the fire. Fireside Feast: Christmas at Embers Ub
 ud awaits from 24–26 December 2026. Gather your favorite people\, raise 
 a glass\, and let the evening unfold around the table. Tickets: https://we
 b.facebook.com/share/1Dd17oehmj/\n\nMore info: https://baligasm.com/event/
 embers-restaurant-fireside-feast-dec-2026\n\nPlease verify with the organi
 zer before attending.
