  spanning everything from Afro House\, Tech House\, Melodic Techno\, Progr
 essive House\, and more\, including Simo White b2b Novecento leading the M
 idnight Countdown set. Throughout the celebration will turn this iconic be
 achfront into the ultimate party destination. When the clock hits midnight
 \, White Rock Beach Club erupts into a full-scale production\, lighting up
  the Uluwatu coastline with a pyro show and making it the perfect spot to 
 celebrate and count down to 2027. Secure your spot with daybeds\, party su
 ites\, and exclusive bottle packages available across multiple zones\, fro
 m beachfront cabana to lawn seating. Don't miss Bali's best beachfront New
  Year's celebration. Book now for New Year's Eve 2026 in Melasti Beach\, U
 luwatu\, Bali — White Rock Beach Club × Abstract. Tickets: https://mega
