DESCRIPTION:2027 ARRIVES AT REGENT COUNTDOWN. New Year's Eve Celebration at
  Beach House On 31 December\, Beach House at Regent Bali Canggu marks the 
 turn of the year in its own style. DJs\, live musicians and a midnight sky
  lit by fireworks over the coastline. Dress well\, raise a glass\, and let
  Regent carry you into 2027. Thursday\, 31 December 2026 · Beach House ×
  Sigma Entertainment Bali ✦ THE LINE-UP: RIBAKOV TALANOV BAMASA Live per
 formances: Dancers · Saxophonist · Violinist · Vocalists ✦ HOW THE NI
 GHT UNFOLDS - 5 PM: Doors open The last sunset of 2026 sets the tone. Cock
 tails are poured as the ocean turns gold. - 8.30 PM: DJs start The music b
 uilds as the night goes on\, from the opening set to the countdown. - All 
 night: Live on stage A saxophonist\, a violinist\, vocalists and dancers p
 erform throughout the evening. - Midnight: The Countdown Ten seconds\, one
  crowd\, and fireworks along the Canggu coast to welcome 2027. ✦ THINGS 
 TO KNOW - Venue: Beach House\, Regent Bali Canggu - Doors open: 5 PM - DJs
  start: 8.30 PM - Dress code: Evening elegance. Dress up for the occasion\
 , but keep it comfortable for a night of celebrating. Shoes are required f
 or all guests. Flip-flops\, swimwear and sportswear are not permitted. - A
 ge policy: Guests all ages are welcome. Guests under 18 must be accompanie
 d by an adult. Valid ID or Passport are required for all guests\, and entr
 y will be refused without it. - Arrival: New Year's Eve traffic in Canggu 
 is heavy\, so plan to arrive early or arrange a driver. ✦ FAQ - What doe
 s my ticket include? Entry for the full night\, including the DJ sets\, li
 ve performances and midnight fireworks. General Admission includes a welco
 me drink. Table Booking includes a minimum spend credit you can use on foo
 d and drinks during the night. - Can I bring my child? Yes. Guests all age
 s are welcome only accompanied by an adult. - When is the best time to arr
 ive? Come at 5 PM to see the last sunset of the year. - What happens if it
  rains? The night goes on whatever the weather. - Is re-entry allowed? Re-
 entry is not permitted once you leave the venue. ✦ TERMS & CONDITIONS - 
 Tickets are non-refundable and non-transferable. - Valid ID or passport is
  required for all guests\, and entry will be refused without it. - Each e-
