 ll guests\, including the shoes requirement. - Outside food\, outside drin
 ks and illegal substances are not permitted. - Management may refuse entry
  to\, or remove\, any guest whose behaviour breaks venue rules or puts the
  safety or comfort of others at risk. - Photography and filming will take 
 place for promotional use. Countdown is coming. Spend it at Regent. Ticket
 s: https://megatix.co.id/events/regent-countdown?utm_source=baligasm\n\nMo
