  to 1:00 AM\, carrying the energy into the countdown and beyond. If you ar
 e searching for a memorable New Year’s Eve dinner in Ubud\, a rooftop ce
 lebration in Bali\, or simply a great place to welcome 2027\, The Copper C
 ountdown is where good food\, music\, cocktails\, and the spirit of a new 
 beginning come together above the heart of Ubud. FESTIVE COCKTAILS AT COPP
