DESCRIPTION:You’ve made the list. Now it’s time to make your New Year
 ’s Eve plans. Welcome 2027 at W Bali – Seminyak with a night of house 
 music\, beachfront energy and a lineup made for the dancefloor. Taking ove
 r the Deck is CASSIMM\, the Italian-born\, London-based DJ and producer kn
 own for his signature house sound. Expect infectious grooves\, rolling bas
 slines\, funk-driven rhythms and the kind of club energy that keeps you mo
 ving long after the first beat drops. Joining him is PIEM\, Barcelona-base
 d DJ\, producer and Music Curator of W Barcelona. With more than two decad
 es in the house music scene\, PIEM brings a groove-led sound built around 
 natural rhythms\, solid basslines and powerful vocals\, with an undergroun
 d edge that keeps the dancefloor engaged. Completing the lineup is Sergio 
 Cucalon\, W Bali – Seminyak’s Music Curator\, bringing his sound and m
 usical selection to the night. Three names. One dancefloor. One night to w
 elcome the year ahead. Come for the music. Stay for the countdown. #MADETH
 ELIST Tickets: https://megatix.co.id/events/made-the-list-party?utm_source
