LOCATION:Potato Head Klymax Discotheque\, Petitenget St No.51B\, Seminyak
DESCRIPTION:For the last night of 2026\, Gero takes Klymax from open to clo
 se. Few artists know Desa Potato Head the way Gero does. His story here be
 gan years ago at Studio Eksotika\, where he ran the shop and quietly shape
 d the record culture around it. Since then he has become one of the Desa
 ’s longest-standing residents\, a familiar presence behind the decks and
  a reference point for anyone who has spent time on these dancefloors. His
  sound draws from European disco\, zouk\, Balearic and rare groove\, carri
 ed through a journey that runs from Jakarta to Bali and beyond. It is musi
 c chosen with patience\, built for long nights and rooms that listen. An a
 ll night long set gives him the space to do exactly that. No handovers\, n
 o compromises\, one selector guiding the room from the first record to the
  first morning of 2027\, on Klymax’s custom Richard Long and George Stav
 ro sound system and sprung dancefloor. Tickets: https://megatix.co.id/even
 ts/klymax-discotheque-nye-gero?utm_source=baligasm\n\nMore info: https://b
 aligasm.com/event/klymax-discotheque-nye-gero-dec-2026\n\nPlease verify wi
